{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "aiwritex-html-313463a17e1e",
  "type": "html-template",
  "original": {
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n\n<body>\n  <section\n    style=\"font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 16px;\">\n\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 28px 20px; background: linear-gradient(160deg, #4e54c8 0%, #8f94fb 100%); color: white; border-radius: 0 0 25px 25px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(78, 84, 200, 0.3); margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n      <h1 style=\"font-size: 2.2rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.2;\">\n        有效学习的<br><span style=\"font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800;\">科学方法论</span></h1>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 15px 0 0; opacity: 0.9; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">解锁高效学习的关键策略\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 20px; margin: 0 0 25px; background: white; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">\n      <svg style=\"width: 65px; height: 65px; display: block; margin: 0 auto 15px;\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"\n        stroke=\"#4e54c8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n        <path\n          d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 00.7 2.81 2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 002.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z\"\n          stroke-dasharray=\"100\" stroke-dashoffset=\"100\">\n          <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"100\" to=\"0\" dur=\"1.5s\" begin=\"0s\" fill=\"freeze\" />\n        </path>\n      </svg>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: center; color: #4e54c8; font-weight: 600;\">前言</h2>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        在信息爆炸的时代，我们每天都面临着海量的知识与信息。然而，拥有高效的学习方法才是应对这种挑战的关键。本文将深入探讨基于认知科学的学习策略，帮助你构建一套个人化的学习系统。</p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        无论你是学生、职场人士还是终身学习者，掌握科学的学习方法不仅能提高学习效率，更能激发学习热情，实现持续成长。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 25px 20px 10px; margin: 0 0 25px; background: white; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: #4e54c8; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-right: 15px;\">\n          <svg style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\">\n            <path d=\"M12 3L1 9l11 6 11-6-11-6zM1 9v6l11 6 11-6V9\" />\n          </svg>\n        </section>\n        <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #333;\">学习的认知基础</h2>\n      </section>\n\n      <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 20px 0 12px; color: #4e54c8; font-weight: 600;\">大脑如何处理信息</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        人类大脑是一个复杂的信息处理系统。工作记忆是我们处理信息的临时空间，但其容量有限，通常只能同时处理4-7个信息单元。这就是为什么我们需要将知识分解成可管理的小块，并构建连接，形成长期记忆。</p>\n\n      <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 20px 0 12px; color: #4e54c8; font-weight: 600;\">注意力与专注</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        注意力是学习的基础。研究表明，人类的深度专注时间约为90分钟，之后需要短暂休息。了解自己的注意力模式，合理安排学习时间段，能显著提高学习效率。</p>\n\n      <section\n        style=\"background: #f1f2ff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 4px solid #4e54c8;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 500; color: #333;\">\n          认知负荷理论提醒我们：学习内容的复杂度应与个人认知能力相匹配，过高或过低都会影响学习效果。</p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 25px 20px; margin: 0 0 25px; background: white; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: #8f94fb; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-right: 15px;\">\n          <svg style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\">\n            <path\n              d=\"M17 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2zm-1 9h-2v2h-2v-2H9V9h3V7h2v2h3v3z\" />\n          </svg>\n        </section>\n        <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #333;\">高效学习的五大核心策略</h2>\n      </section>\n\n      <h3\n        style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 25px 0 12px; color: #8f94fb; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n        <span\n          style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; background: #8f94fb; color: white; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem;\">1</span>主动回顾\n      </h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        主动回顾是指在学习后，不依赖书本或笔记，主动从记忆中提取信息。这种\"提取练习\"比简单地重读材料更有效。研究表明，测试自己比重复阅读能提高40%以上的记忆保留率。</p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        实践方法：学习完一个章节后，合上书本，尝试回忆关键概念和要点。可以通过自问自答或向他人解释的方式进行。</p>\n\n      <h3\n        style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 25px 0 12px; color: #8f94fb; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n        <span\n          style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; background: #8f94fb; color: white; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem;\">2</span>间隔重复\n      </h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        人类大脑遵循\"遗忘曲线\"，我们需要在即将遗忘前复习知识。间隔重复是根据记忆规律，安排最佳复习时间的学习方法。</p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        最佳复习间隔：第一次复习在学习后24小时内，第二次在3-4天后，第三次在7-10天后，之后可以延长到一个月。</p>\n\n      <h3\n        style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 0 0 12px; color: #8f94fb; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n        <span\n          style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; background: #8f94fb; color: white; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem;\">3</span>知识连接\n      </h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        大脑以网络形式存储信息，新知识需要与已有知识建立联系才能更好地记忆。将新知识与已知概念联系起来，形成知识网络，大大提高理解和记忆效果。</p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        实践工具：思维导图是构建知识网络的绝佳工具，通过视觉化方式展示概念间的关系，有助于全局理解。</p>\n\n      <section\n        style=\"background: #f8f9ff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n        <svg style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; margin-right: 15px;\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M9 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4\" stroke=\"#4e54c8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n            stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n          <path d=\"M16 17l5-5-5-5\" stroke=\"#4e54c8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n          <path d=\"M21 12H9\" stroke=\"#4e54c8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n        </svg>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #555; font-style: italic;\">\"不是孤立的事实，而是相互关联的概念网络，才是真正的知识。\" —\n          认知科学家戴维·奥苏贝尔</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <h3\n        style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 25px 0 12px; color: #8f94fb; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n        <span\n          style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; background: #8f94fb; color: white; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem;\">4</span>深度加工\n      </h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        信息加工的深度决定了记忆的牢固程度。对知识进行深度思考、分析和转化，比单纯阅读或重复更有效。深度加工包括：提问、分析、评价、应用和创造等高阶思维活动。</p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">实践方法：使用费曼技巧 —\n        用简单语言向他人（或假想对象）解释复杂概念，找出自己理解的空白点。这种\"教学式学习\"能促进深度理解。</p>\n\n      <h3\n        style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 25px 0 12px; color: #8f94fb; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n        <span\n          style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; background: #8f94fb; color: white; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem;\">5</span>实践应用\n      </h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        知识只有通过实践应用才能真正内化。将学到的概念应用到实际问题中，不仅加深理解，还能发现知识的局限性和新的问题。</p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        实践方法：设计小项目、解决实际问题、参与讨论或教授他人。通过\"做中学\"，将抽象知识转化为具体能力。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 25px 20px 10px; margin: 0 0 25px; background: white; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: #4e54c8; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-right: 15px;\">\n          <svg style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\">\n            <path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5\" />\n          </svg>\n        </section>\n        <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #333;\">构建个人学习系统</h2>\n      </section>\n\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        有效学习不仅需要方法，还需要一个完整的学习系统。这个系统应包含知识输入、处理、输出和回顾四个环节。</p>\n\n      <section style=\"background: #f5f7fa; border-radius: 15px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0;\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0 0 15px; color: #4e54c8; font-weight: 600;\">学习系统四大模块</h3>\n\n        <section style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n          <h4 style=\"font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #333; font-weight: 600;\">1. 知识采集</h4>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #555;\">阅读、听讲、观察、体验等多渠道获取信息，注重信息源的质量和多样性。</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n          <h4 style=\"font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #333; font-weight: 600;\">2. 知识处理</h4>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #555;\">笔记整理、概念梳理、问题提出，将零散信息转化为结构化知识。</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n          <h4 style=\"font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #333; font-weight: 600;\">3. 知识应用</h4>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #555;\">解决问题、创作分享、教授他人，通过输出促进深度理解。</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section>\n          <h4 style=\"font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #333; font-weight: 600;\">4. 知识复习</h4>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #555;\">间隔重复、定期回顾、系统梳理，防止遗忘，强化记忆。</p>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n\n      <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 25px 0 15px; color: #4e54c8; font-weight: 600;\">数字化学习工具</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        现代学习者可以借助各种数字工具构建个人知识管理系统：</p>\n\n      <section\n        style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; margin: 15px 0;\">\n        <section style=\"padding: 12px; background: #f5f7fa; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 5px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: #4e54c8;\">笔记工具</p>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #555;\">Notion, Obsidian, Evernote</p>\n        </section>\n        <section style=\"padding: 12px; background: #f5f7fa; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 5px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: #4e54c8;\">闪卡工具</p>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #555;\">Anki, Quizlet, RemNote</p>\n        </section>\n        <section style=\"padding: 12px; background: #f5f7fa; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 5px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: #4e54c8;\">思维导图</p>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #555;\">XMind, MindMeister</p>\n        </section>\n        <section style=\"padding: 12px; background: #f5f7fa; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 5px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: #4e54c8;\">时间管理</p>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #555;\">Todoist, Forest, Pomodoro</p>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 25px 20px 10px; margin: 0 0 25px; background: white; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: #8f94fb; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-right: 15px;\">\n          <svg style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\">\n            <path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\" />\n          </svg>\n        </section>\n        <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #333;\">克服学习障碍</h2>\n      </section>\n\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; color: #444;\">\n        即使掌握了科学的学习方法，我们仍会面临各种学习障碍。了解这些障碍并有针对性地解决，是高效学习的关键部分。</p>\n\n      <section\n        style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #e4e8f0 100%); border-radius: 15px; padding: 5px; margin: 20px 0;\">\n        <section style=\"background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0 0 10px; color: #8f94fb; font-weight: 600;\">拖延症</h3>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #444;\">拖延往往源于对任务的恐惧或对完美的追求。</p>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #444; font-weight: 500;\">\n            解决策略：使用\"番茄工作法\"，将任务分解为25分钟的小段；设置明确的起止时间；采用\"先糟糕，再完善\"的策略开始工作。</p>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n\n      <section\n        style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #e4e8f0 100%); border-radius: 15px; padding: 5px; margin: 20px 0;\">\n        <section style=\"background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0 0 10px; color: #8f94fb; font-weight: 600;\">注意力分散</h3>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #444;\">数字时代，我们面临前所未有的注意力挑战。</p>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #444; font-weight: 500;\">\n            解决策略：创建专注环境，消除手机等干扰源；使用\"深度工作\"时段，集中精力于单一任务；定期进行正念训练，提升注意力控制能力。</p>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n\n      <section\n        style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #e4e8f0 100%); border-radius: 15px; padding: 5px; margin: 20px 0;\">\n        <section style=\"background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0 0 10px; color: #8f94fb; font-weight: 600;\">动力不足</h3>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #444;\">长期学习过程中保持动力是一大挑战。</p>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #444; font-weight: 500;\">\n            解决策略：明确学习目标与个人意义的连接；设定小型可达成的里程碑；建立学习社区，获得社交支持；定期奖励自己的学习成果。</p>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"padding: 25px 20px 20px; margin: 0 0 25px; background: linear-gradient(160deg, #4e54c8 0%, #8f94fb 100%); color: white; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(78, 84, 200, 0.3);\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 20px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center;\">结语：学习是一生的旅程</h2>\n\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; opacity: 0.9;\">\n        掌握科学的学习方法不仅能提高学习效率，更能让学习变成一种享受。在信息爆炸的时代，高效学习已成为最重要的元技能之一。</p>\n\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; opacity: 0.9;\">\n        记住，学习不只是为了应对考试或完成任务，而是一个持续成长、拓展认知边界的终身过程。愿每个人都能找到适合自己的学习方法，享受知识探索的乐趣。</p>\n\n      <section style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 25px;\">\n        <svg style=\"width: 60px; height: 60px;\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M12 2v20M2 12h20\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dasharray\" from=\"0 44\" to=\"44 44\" dur=\"1s\" begin=\"0s\" fill=\"freeze\" />\n          </path>\n          <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\">\n            <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dasharray\" from=\"0 63\" to=\"63 63\" dur=\"1.5s\" begin=\"0s\" fill=\"freeze\" />\n          </circle>\n        </svg>\n        <p style=\"margin: 15px 0 0; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px;\">KEEP LEARNING</p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n</body>\n\n</html>"
  },
  "html": "<section style=\"padding: 24px; color: #292b2e; background-color: #fff\"><h1 style=\"font-size: 2.2rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.2\">把阅读变成一次舒服的停留</h1><section><p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 15px 0 0; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px\">文章的第一眼，决定读者愿不愿意停下来。好排版让观点先被看见，再让细节慢慢展开。</p><p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 15px 0 0; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499951360447-b19be8fe80f5?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85\" alt=\"桌面上的阅读与写作\"/></p><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: center; color: #4e54c8; font-weight: 600\">从标题开始，建立阅读节奏</h2><p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 15px 0 0; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong>重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p><blockquote><p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 15px 0 0; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote><p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 15px 0 0; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: center; color: #4e54c8; font-weight: 600\">三个可以马上检查的地方</h2><ul><li>标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li>章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li>重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul><p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 15px 0 0; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1455390582262-044cdead277a?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85\" alt=\"写作中的页面\"/></p><p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 15px 0 0; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515378791036-0648a3ef77b2?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85\" alt=\"工作台上的笔记\"/></p><table><thead><tr><th>检查项</th><th>观察方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>标题</td><td>第一眼能否找到主题</td></tr><tr><td>正文</td><td>是否能够连续阅读</td></tr><tr><td>引用</td><td>是否与作者叙述区分</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 15px 0 0; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544947950-fa07a98d237f?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85\" alt=\"打开的杂志与页面\"/></p><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: center; color: #4e54c8; font-weight: 600\">把风格落实到每一个细节</h2><p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 15px 0 0; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px\">报纸用硬边栏线建立秩序，杂志用大留白放慢速度，信笺让段落像一次自然的交谈。</p><p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 15px 0 0; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1481627834876-b7833e8f5570?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85\" alt=\"阅读中的书页\"/></p><p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 15px 0 0; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px\">一个完整的句子，不应该为了装饰被删掉。一张原有的表格，也不应该被换成没有事实来源的数字。</p><p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 15px 0 0; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px\">读完之后，留下一个清楚的观点，比留下许多重复的色块更有价值。</p></section></section>",
  "layoutPrompt": "[cw-imported-style:{\"root\":\"padding:24px;color:#292b2e;background-color:#fff\",\"elements\":{\"h1\":\"font-size: 2.2rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.2\",\"h2\":\"font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: center; color: #4e54c8; font-weight: 600\",\"h3\":\"font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 20px 0 12px; color: #4e54c8; font-weight: 600\",\"h4\":\"font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #333; font-weight: 600\",\"p\":\"font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 15px 0 0; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px\",\"span\":\"font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800\"}}]",
